 "We already did the heavy lifting, the angular momentum for this is just the \
zz-term of the tensor we found. I\[CloseCurlyQuote]ll define ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         OverscriptBox["\[Omega]", "\[RightVector]"], "\[LongEqual]", 
